/-!
# Direct list storage for the complete first F1 component cache

The existing cache builds its stored pairs by repeatedly indexing the original
key and value arrays. This upward fixture instead traverses the same key list
and exact value literals directly. Equality of the entire cache record preserves
all full queries, residual expressions, lookup results and fallback behavior.
No component is recomputed and no new numerical or geometric input is supplied.
-/

@[expose] public section
set_option maxRecDepth 65536
set_option Elab.async false
set_option autoImplicit false

namespace AxiomaticGW.BlowupF1CompleteHComponentsFlat
open SurfaceGenusTwo
open BlowupF1CompleteHComponents (key keyList value entries)
abbrev X := SurfaceTarget.hirzebruchOne

